   "wordStart": 10,
   "wordEnd": 14
  },
  {
   "text": "That is rarer than you think.",
   "start": 8.199,
   "end": 9.779,
   "wordStart": 15,
   "wordEnd": 20
  },
  {
   "text": "Most people use systems.",
   "start": 10.539,
