   "wordStart": 21,
   "wordEnd": 24
  },
  {
   "text": "You see through them.",
   "start": 13.5,
   "end": 14.519,
   "wordStart": 25,
   "wordEnd": 28
  },
  {
   "text": "You were taught to wait for permission.",
   "start": 15.399,
   "end": 17.559,
   "wordStart": 29,
   "wordEnd": 35
  },
  {
   "text": "You do not need it.",
   "start": 18.359,
   "end": 19.219,
   "wordStart": 36,
   "wordEnd": 40
  },
  {
   "text": "The ones who build are not different.",
